    "status": "finding",
    "summary": "The Repair Tool's stored values: repair 40 per second (60 upgraded) and 'AntiRepair' 30 (45) in the registry; a vehicle damage rank table 10 to 20 and a heal rank table 2.5 to 20 in affectors; and a stacking table that scales each of 2 to 8 sources by 0.75 down to 0.25, so combined repair tops out near twice one repairer. Which figure is the damage to enemy vehicles is not settled; L3385's statement that the anti-repair rows are not that damage is withdrawn. 81 raw-offset checks matched.",
